note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note cg_dec.om: hand port of src/omega_blackwell_codegen_dec.c (decode glue kernels) to seeded Omega.
note Entry cg_dec kind a b c x m: kind = OmegaDecSpec.kind (u32), a = mode | width << 32,
note b = stride | groups << 32, c = (uint32_t)mutant. Result 0 built, 1 refused, 2 emit error.
note State array s: s0 kind, s1 mode, s2 stride, s3 mutant bits, s4 width, s5 groups; other slots hold
note the virtual registers below, allocated in the C declaration order so vreg numbers match.
note f32 constants (Wolfram-verified bits, evidence/codegen-dec/2026-11-06/wolfram.txt):
note 973078528 = 0x3A000000 = 1/2048, 3216550459 = 0xBFB8AA3B = -log2(e), 1065353216 = 0x3F800000 = 1,
note 1258291200 = 0x4B000000 = 2^23, 1602224128 = 0x5F800000 = 2^64, 226492416 = 0x0D800000 = 2^-100,
note 1065361408 = 0x3F802000 = 1 + 2^-10, 897581056 = 0x35800000 = 2^-20.
