fn am_b x edit ulong 8192 m edit ulong 512 s edit ulong 256 jn ulong to void
mm = get s KMM
e_mov x m mm qe s KVQ 0
for j ulong jn
if gt j 0
e_fop x m 37 mm mm qe s KVQ j
end
end
wred x m 37 mm get s KT
a0 = get s KA0
e_imadi x m a0 get s KWARP 4 ALL
e_imadi x m a0 get s KONE 0 a0
l0sts x m get s KLANE get s KONE a0 mm
