wred x m 36 best get s KT
a0 = get s KA0
e_imadi x m a0 get s KWARP 4 ALL
e_imadi x m a0 get s KONE 64 a0
l0sts x m get s KLANE get s KONE a0 best
e_bar x m
cred x m s best 64 36
e_andi x m best best 8388607
e_isetp x m get s KTID get s KONE
r = e_rgn x m
oa = nv64 m
e_imadw x m oa get s KCX 4 get s KP2
e_stg x m oa get s KMX
e_imadw x m oa get s KCX 4 get s KP3
